/E (Custom CNNs designed specifically for neuroimaging classification offer tight control over architecture depth, regularisation, and augmentation strategy. AbdulAzeem et al. [2] proposed an eight-layer CNN trained end-to-end on the ADNI structural MRI dataset, achieving 99.8% binary accuracy for AD versus cognitively)
/Pg 9 0 R
